# Copy to redirects.csv (in the client repo root) for your own redirects. One per line:
#   from,to[,status]      status defaults to 301 (permanent)
# "from" is a path on this site; "to" is a path or a full URL. These win over the redirects
# generated automatically from the WordPress export (see site/redirects.mjs).
from,to,status
# /old-page/,/new-page/
# /donate-now/,https://www.canadahelps.org/en/charities/example/,302
